{"version":1,"content":"<p>邱士縉（Stanley）與相戀9年的未婚妻李炘頤（Alina）結婚，Stanley成為MIRROR首位人夫，今天（14日）Alina在社交平台發放幾張婚照，當中包括穿裙褂及婚紗靚相，Stanley還抱起太太，而Alina則鬼馬伸脷兼舉起無名指曬婚戒，她以英文寫道：\" Legally official\"，不少圈中人留言恭賀包括張繼聰﹑謝安琪﹑張紋嘉等。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.860978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T04:48:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.659072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"4da43d7628eb17f9e231884854d0ab23dbcd5b469b13174e218e046605914e0c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}